dot/pull/100293. Draft until it is finalized and merged.\r\n\r\nThis removes RenderingDeviceDriver's own `VectorView` struct in favour of core's `Span`.\r\n\r\nIt may have been somewhat easier to merge the two, had `VectorView` not chosen to utilize implicit conversions. Implicit conversions _will_ break your neck because you will sooner or later run into ambiguous calls and / or unwanted conversions. Better to address it now than later. I had tried to do it with `Span` as well, but very soon ran into issues because of overload clashes in `String`.\r\n\r\nOther than that, the migration was fairly uneventful.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-12-12T22:17:26Z","updated_at":"2024-12-13T08:38:30Z","closed_at":"2024-12-13T01:25:53Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Ivorforce:vector-view-span","ref":"vector-view-span","repo":{"id":861387944,"node_id":"R_kgDOM1e8qA","name":"godot","full_name":"Ivorforce/godot","owner":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.gi